  "visualFindings": [
    "The candidate enlarged from raw bounds was rejected in favor of a smaller frame-normalized correction. Shared center X moves 429 to 431; center Y stays 394. Nominal width/height are 25.5/22.5, with high-quality mask sampling.",
    "All complete, guarded W/U/A comparisons improve edge F1 at both tiers. The independently registered reference explains why raw scores disagree; never relabel the raw median as improved.",
    "There are 224 distinct raw edge regressions greater than .02, including 136 on materials without validated registration. Their identities and scores remain available. These materials are not certified by the W/U/A result.",
    "Aligned calibration crops, the six lowest aligned cases and the six largest raw regressions on unvalidated materials were inspected. Unvalidated cases are Wall of Heat, Eureka, Typhoon, Master of the Hunt, Storm Seeker and Durkwood Boars.",
    "Equinox was also inspected as a full scan. Its printed symbol lies unusually far right and is clipped by the fixed score window. Retain its partial scores as diagnostics, excluding it from complete-symbol summaries. Add automatic reference-region coverage checks before scaling scoring.",
    "Column capital proportions, rounded internal channels and edge contours still differ from the retained stencil. Frame art/rules boundaries, texture and color remain separate work."
  ],
